# Required bounded UI capture: observe the real splash state before trying
# any historical ending cheat. The unchanged ui-ending-shortcut.script is
# manual-only: its proposed 0x5B ending transition remains unproven.
# Optional startup probe: recovered splash state and public ending shortcut.
